#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:6
#: 443cbdbac3024e80905ab1f1f9f6fba0
msgid "Repeater for Wireless Ground Station Connections"
msgstr "无线地面站连接中继器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:8
#: 16686f4afb334e268f580cd5554c2523
msgid ""
"This page illustrates how wireless connectivity between the Ground Control "
"Station and the Telemetry Radio Receiver can be accomplished."
msgstr "本页面介绍如何实现地面站与数传接收机之间的无线连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:11
#: 2b24c38e985b44bab0a05bd11afc1281
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:13
#: b54e6106e9f7427e9a6219b4c0fb1408
msgid ""
"When using radio telemetry with ArduPilot, rather than attaching the "
"telemetry receiver with a USB cable to the PC or Phone running the Ground "
"Control Station (GCS) software, it is often more convenient to use a "
"wireless repeater. This repeater will convert the telemetry radio receiver's"
" output to either Bluetooth or WIFI for wireless connection to the GCS. In "
"the case of a phone based GCS, it allows full freedom to move around while "
"flying or driving the vehicle. And in the case where a directional receiving"
" antenna is used, it allows the telemetry receiver to be placed high up, "
"away from the GCS for optimum reception."
msgstr ""
"使用 ArduPilot 无线数传时，相比通过 USB "
"线将数传接收机连接到运行地面站（GCS）软件的电脑或手机，使用无线中继器通常更为方便。该中继器将数传接收机的输出转换为蓝牙或 "
"WIFI，实现与地面站的无线连接。对于手机端地面站，这允许飞行或驾驶飞行器时自由走动。对于使用定向接收天线的情况，还可将数传接收机放置在高处远离地面站，以获得最佳接收效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:23
#: 397cca2c06924a7e815986be799fc5b0
msgid "Components"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:25
#: 21e9c559a59944589498235d9a842da5
msgid ""
"The repeater can be made very inexpensively and small, fitting into a small "
"case. The required components are:"
msgstr "中继器可以做得非常廉价和小巧，装入小型外壳中。所需组件为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:27
#: e1f0f4381b5740c5a38f195b3d5c5a1c
msgid ""
"Telemetry receiver such as a Sik radio. Preferably, the vehicle version "
"since USB connection is not used, but a USB version can be easily converted "
"for this application. See section below."
msgstr "数传接收机，如 SiK 无线电。优先使用飞行器版本（不带 USB 连接），但 USB 版本也可轻松改造用于此应用。见下文章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:28
#: 1eff70ea29cf4acaa5b8b8c1f106641b
msgid ""
"Either an HC-06 Bluetooth module, or ESP8266 WIFI module. For use with a "
"phone, either works well, with WIFI having further range than Bluetooth. For"
" computer GCS, since most portable PCs do not have BT integrated, WIFI may "
"be the best choice since most PCs have this integrated."
msgstr ""
"HC-06 蓝牙模块或 ESP8266 WIFI 模块之一。用于手机时两者均可，WIFI "
"比蓝牙传输距离更远。用于电脑地面站时，由于大多数便携电脑未集成蓝牙，WIFI 可能是更好的选择，因为大多数电脑已集成 WIFI。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:29
#: 5ceab28fdea140b481073dc0a3b24753
msgid ""
"5V step down regulator for dropping the battery (2s-4s LIPO is ideal) to 5V "
"needed by the above."
msgstr "5V 降压稳压器，用于将电池（2s-4s 锂电池最佳）降至上述模块所需的 5V。"

