#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:41
#: 701047def329437ebe97bd49e0841fb5
msgid "Bluetooth Module Baud Rate"
msgstr "蓝牙模块波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wireless-gcs-repeater.rst:43
#: 1a44c53fc8aa4038b6b2f2db9cdcc9bb
msgid ""
"The module must be set for 57600 baud to work with the telemetry radio. How "
"to change the baud rate is discussed `here "
"<https://www.instructables.com/id/AT-command-mode-of-HC-05-Bluetooth-"
"module/>`__."
msgstr ""
"模块必须设置为 57600 波特率才能与数传模块配合工作。更改波特率的方法见 `此处 "
"<https://www.instructables.com/id/AT-command-mode-of-HC-05-Bluetooth-"
"module/>`__。"

